Groups)"},"1766":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions-14","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions#list-topics","content":"List topics"},"1767":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions-15","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions#create-a-topic","content":"Create a topic"},"1768":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions-16","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions#get-update-or-delete-a-topic","content":"Get, update or delete a topic"},"1769":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions-17","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions#topic-opt-outs-members","content":"Topic opt-outs (members)"},"1770":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions-18","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions#suppression-object-reference","content":"Suppression Object Reference"},"1771":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions-19","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions#suppressions-api","content":"Suppressions stop mail to addresses that should not receive it. NorthRelay has two layers:"},"1772":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions-20","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions#suppressions-api","content":"**Account-level suppressions** block an address for your whole account. NorthRelay adds them automatically on hard bounces, spam complaints and \"unsubscribe from all\"; you can also add them yourself."},"1773":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions-21","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions#suppressions-api","content":"**Topics** (stored as suppression groups) let a recipient opt out of one category of mail, such as \"Product updates\", while still receiving the rest."},"1774":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions-22","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions#suppressions-api","content":"To subscribe or unsubscribe a recipient with the right side effects (contact status, list membership, webhooks), use the Subscriptions API. The routes on this page manage the underlying records directly."},"1775":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions-23","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions#suppressions-api","content":"**Scopes:** `suppressions:read` for `GET`, `suppressions:write` for everything else, on both `/suppressions/**` and `/suppression-groups/**`."},"1776":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions-24","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions#how-suppressions-apply-when-you-send","content":"NorthRelay filters every recipient before the message is queued. Filtered recipients are dropped and do not count against your monthly quota."},"1777":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions-25","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions#how-suppressions-apply-when-you-send","content":"| Mail                                             | Blocked by                                                                                                                                            |\n| ------------------------------------------------ | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Marketing (campaigns, marketing message streams) | Any account-level suppression; contact status `UNSUBSCRIBED`, `BOUNCED`, `COMPLAINED` or `CLEANED`; an opt-out of the topic the message is sent under |","table":"table-0"},"1778":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions-26","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions#how-suppressions-apply-when-you-send","content":"| Mail          | Blocked by                                                                                                                                                  |\n| ------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Transactional | Only `Bounce` and `Complaint` suppressions and contact status `BOUNCED`, `COMPLAINED` or `CLEANED`. Unsubscribes do not block receipts and password resets. |","table":"table-0"},"1779":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions-27","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions#how-suppressions-apply-when-you-send","content":"Suppression reasons:"},"1780":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions-28","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions#how-suppressions-apply-when-you-send","content":"| `reason` | Added when                                         | Lifted by a subscribe call? |\n| -------- | -------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------- |\n| `Bounce` | Hard bounce (5xx) reported by the receiving server | Never                       |","table":"table-1"},"1781":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions-29","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions#how-suppressions-apply-when-you-send","content":"| `reason`    | Added when                         | Lifted by a subscribe call? |\n| ----------- | ---------------------------------- | --------------------------- |\n| `Complaint` | Spam complaint via a feedback loop | Never                       |","table":"table-1"},"1782":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions-30","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions#how-suppressions-apply-when-you-send","content":"| `reason`      | Added when                                                                           | Lifted by a subscribe call?     |\n| ------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ | ------------------------------- |\n| `Unsubscribe` | The recipient unsubscribed from all mail (link, one-click, preference centre or API) | Only with `\"resubscribe\": true` |","table":"table-1"},"1783":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions-31","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions#how-suppressions-apply-when-you-send","content":"| `reason` | Added when   | Lifted by a subscribe call? |\n| -------- | ------------ | --------------------------- |\n| `Manual` | You added it | Never; delete it yourself   |","table":"table-1"},"1784":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions-32","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions#query-parameters","content":"| Parameter | Type    | Default | Description |\n| --------- | ------- | ------- | ----------- |\n| `page`    | integer | `1`     | Page number |","table":"table-2"},"1785":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions-33","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions#query-parameters","content":"| Parameter | Type    | Default | Description              |\n| --------- | ------- | ------- | ------------------------ |\n| `limit`   | integer | `25`    | Items per page (max 100) |","table":"table-2"},"1786":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions-34","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions#query-parameters","content":"| Parameter | Type   | Default | Description                                      |\n| --------- | ------ | ------- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n| `reason`  | string | --      | `Bounce`, `Complaint`, `Unsubscribe` or `Manual` |","table":"table-2"},"1787":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions-35","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions#query-parameters","content":"| Parameter | Type   | Default | Description                       |\n| --------- | ------ | ------- | --------------------------------- |\n| `search`  | string | --      | Matches part of the email address |","table":"table-2"},"1788":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions-36","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions#example-response","content":"`details` is free-form and depends on how the suppression was created (for unsubscribes it records the `method` and `campaignId`)."},"1789":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions-37","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions#get-a-suppression","content":"Returns the suppression for one address, or `404 RESOURCE_NOT_FOUND` when the address is not suppressed. URL-encode the address. To see suppression, contact status, lists and topics together, use `GET /subscriptions/{email}`."},"1790":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions-38","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions#request-body","content":"| Field   | Type   | Required | Description               |\n| ------- | ------ | -------- | ------------------------- |\n| `email` | string | Yes      | Email address to suppress |","table":"table-3"},"1791":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions-39","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions#request-body","content":"| Field    | Type   | Required | Description                                      |\n| -------- | ------ | -------- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n| `reason` | string | Yes      | `Bounce`, `Complaint`, `Unsubscribe` or `Manual` |","table":"table-3"},"1792":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions-40","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions#request-body","content":"| Field     | Type   | Required | Description                                          |\n| --------- | ------ | -------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| `details` | object | No       | Free-form notes, for example a support ticket number |","table":"table-3"},"1793":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions-41","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions#request-body","content":"If the address is already suppressed, its reason and details are updated."},"1794":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions-42","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions#example-request-1","content":"Returns `201` with the suppression in `data`."},"1795":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions-43","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions#example-request-1","content":"Adding an `Unsubscribe` suppression here does not change the contact's status or fire a webhook. To record an opt-out, prefer `POST /subscriptions/unsubscribe`."},"1796":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions-44","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions#bulk-add-or-remove","content":"API key only."},"1797":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions-45","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions#bulk-add-or-remove","content":"| Field    | Type   | Required | Description       |\n| -------- | ------ | -------- | ----------------- |\n| `action` | string | Yes      | `add` or `remove` |","table":"table-4"},"1798":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions-46","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions#bulk-add-or-remove","content":"| Field    | Type     | Required | Description        |\n| -------- | -------- | -------- | ------------------ |\n| `emails` | string[] | Yes      | 1–10,000 addresses |","table":"table-4"},"1799":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions-47","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions#bulk-add-or-remove","content":"| Field    | Type   | Required               | Description                                      |\n| -------- | ------ | ---------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n| `reason` | string | When `action` is `add` | `Bounce`, `Complaint`, `Unsubscribe` or `Manual` |","table":"table-4"},"1800":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions-48","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions#bulk-add-or-remove","content":"`updated` counts addresses that were already suppressed with a different reason. With `action: \"remove\"` the response is `{ action, requested, removed }`."},"1801":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions-49","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions#remove-suppression","content":"Only remove a `Bounce` or `Complaint` suppression when you have confirmed the address is valid and wants your mail. Sending to addresses that bounced or complained damages your sender reputation and the shared sending IP."},"1802":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions-50","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions#topics-suppression-groups","content":"A topic is a category of mail that recipients can opt out of on its own. Each topic is a suppression group, and **a member of the group is an address that opted out of that topic**. \"Subscribing\" someone to a topic means removing them from the group."},"1803":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions-51","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions#topics-suppression-groups","content":"Topics take effect on marketing mail when you send:"},"1804":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions-52","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions#topics-suppression-groups","content":"a campaign with a subscription topic set,"},"1805":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions-53","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions#topics-suppression-groups","content":"a campaign to a list that is tagged with the topic (`suppressionGroupId` on the list),"},"1806":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions-54","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions#topics-suppression-groups","content":"a marketing-stream API message with `\"suppressionGroupId\": \"<topicId>\"` on the send request."},"1807":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions-55","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions#topics-suppression-groups","content":"Recipients who opted out of the topic are skipped. Transactional mail ignores topic opt-outs. Recipients can manage published topics themselves on NorthRelay's hosted preference centre (`{{preferences_url}}`), or on your own page through `GET` / `PATCH /subscriptions/{email}`."},"1808":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions-56","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions#topics-suppression-groups","content":"Prefer the Subscriptions API for opt-ins and opt-outs: `POST /subscriptions/unsubscribe` with `scope: \"topic\"` also removes the recipient from lists tagged with the topic and fires `contact.unsubscribed`. The member routes below only edit the group."},"1809":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions-57","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions#list-topics","content":"| Parameter | Type    | Default | Description |\n| --------- | ------- | ------- | ----------- |\n| `page`    | integer | `1`     | Page number |","table":"table-5"},"1810":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions-58","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions#list-topics","content":"| Parameter | Type    | Default | Description              |\n| --------- | ------- | ------- | ------------------------ |\n| `limit`   | integer | `25`    | Items per page (max 100) |","table":"table-5"},"1811":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions-59","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions#list-topics","content":"| Parameter   | Type    | Default | Description                                                                        |\n| ----------- | ------- | ------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `published` | boolean | --      | `true` returns only topics shown on the hosted preference centre, in display order |","table":"table-5"},"1812":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions-60","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions#list-topics","content":"`_count.members` is the number of addresses that opted out."},"1813":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions-61","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/suppressions","tags":[],"