lowed; configure the final endpoint URL. Deliveries have a 10-second deadline. These rules apply to test deliveries too."},"1939":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-34","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#webhooks","content":"Webhooks deliver real-time HTTP POST notifications to your server when email events occur (delivery, bounce, open, click, etc.). Use webhooks to update your application state, trigger workflows, or monitor deliverability."},"1940":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-35","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#webhooks","content":"**Tier requirement:** Webhooks are available on Starter ($5/mo) and above: 1 endpoint on Starter, 3 on Micro, 10 on Pro, unlimited on Scale."},"1941":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-36","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#event-types","content":"Subscribe a webhook to any of these values in `events`:"},"1942":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-37","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#event-types","content":"| Event          | Description                              | Trigger                             |\n| -------------- | ---------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `email.queued` | Message accepted and queued for delivery | API, batch, scheduled or inbox send |","table":"table-0"},"1943":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-38","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#event-types","content":"| Event             | Description                                   | Trigger                  |\n| ----------------- | --------------------------------------------- | ------------------------ |\n| `email.delivered` | Email accepted by the recipient's mail server | Successful SMTP delivery |","table":"table-0"},"1944":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-39","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#event-types","content":"| Event           | Description                            | Trigger                      |\n| --------------- | -------------------------------------- | ---------------------------- |\n| `email.bounced` | Email rejected by the receiving server | Bounce reported by the relay |","table":"table-0"},"1945":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-40","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#event-types","content":"| Event            | Description                            | Trigger           |\n| ---------------- | -------------------------------------- | ----------------- |\n| `email.deferred` | Email temporarily rejected; will retry | 4xx SMTP response |","table":"table-0"},"1946":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-41","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#event-types","content":"| Event           | Description          | Trigger                                                        |\n| --------------- | -------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `email.dropped` | Message was not sent | A batch or scheduled send failed, or a duplicate was discarded |","table":"table-0"},"1947":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-42","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#event-types","content":"| Event            | Description              | Trigger                          |\n| ---------------- | ------------------------ | -------------------------------- |\n| `email.received` | Inbound message received | Inbound mail to a hosted mailbox |","table":"table-0"},"1948":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-43","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#event-types","content":"| Event          | Description                               | Trigger               |\n| -------------- | ----------------------------------------- | --------------------- |\n| `email.opened` | A person opened the email (bots filtered) | Tracking pixel loaded |","table":"table-0"},"1949":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-44","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#event-types","content":"| Event           | Description                                     | Trigger               |\n| --------------- | ----------------------------------------------- | --------------------- |\n| `email.clicked` | A person clicked a tracked link (bots filtered) | Tracked link followed |","table":"table-0"},"1950":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-45","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#event-types","content":"| Event                | Description                                    | Trigger                                                      |\n| -------------------- | ---------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `contact.subscribed` | Someone subscribed, or opted back into a topic | Signup form, Subscriptions API, list join, preference centre |","table":"table-0"},"1951":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-46","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#event-types","content":"| Event               | Description                   | Trigger                                 |\n| ------------------- | ----------------------------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| `contact.confirmed` | A double opt-in was confirmed | Recipient clicked the confirmation link |","table":"table-0"},"1952":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-47","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#event-types","content":"| Event                  | Description                                             | Trigger                                                           |\n| ---------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `contact.unsubscribed` | Someone unsubscribed from everything, a list or a topic | Unsubscribe link, one-click, preference centre, Subscriptions API |","table":"table-0"},"1953":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-48","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#event-types","content":"| Event               | Description             | Trigger                                                                                                              |\n| ------------------- | ----------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `list.member_added` | A contact joined a list | Subscriptions API, list member API, preference centre (signup forms report the list in `contact.subscribed` instead) |","table":"table-0"},"1954":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-49","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#event-types","content":"| Event                 | Description           | Trigger                                                        |\n| --------------------- | --------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `list.member_removed` | A contact left a list | Unsubscribe from a list or topic, or removal by the list owner |","table":"table-0"},"1955":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-50","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#event-types","content":"| Event                         | Description                | Trigger                                                     |\n| ----------------------------- | -------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `auth.success`, `auth.failed` | SMTP authentication events | Accepted in `events`; reserved for SMTP login notifications |","table":"table-0"},"1956":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-51","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#event-types","content":"Payloads for the contact, list and engagement events are documented in Contact, list and engagement events."},"1957":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-52","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#list-webhooks","content":"Retrieve all configured webhook endpoints."},"1958":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-53","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#example-response","content":"The full secret is never listed; only `secretPrefix`."},"1959":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-54","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#create-webhook","content":"Register a new webhook endpoint."},"1960":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-55","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#request-body","content":"| Field | Type   | Required | Description                                        |\n| ----- | ------ | -------- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| `url` | string | Yes      | HTTPS endpoint URL that will receive POST requests |","table":"table-1"},"1961":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-56","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#request-body","content":"| Field    | Type     | Required | Descriptio