g your first email, verify it was delivered successfully:"},"2726":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/first-email-22","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/first-email","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/first-email#1-check-dashboard-logs","content":"Go to **Dashboard → Email Logs**. You should see your email with one of these statuses:"},"2727":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/first-email-23","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/first-email","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/first-email#1-check-dashboard-logs","content":"| Status   | Meaning                               |\n| -------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| `queued` | Email accepted and waiting to be sent |","table":"table-0"},"2728":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/first-email-24","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/first-email","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/first-email#1-check-dashboard-logs","content":"| Status | Meaning                                         |\n| ------ | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| `sent` | Email handed off to the recipient's mail server |","table":"table-0"},"2729":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/first-email-25","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/first-email","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/first-email#1-check-dashboard-logs","content":"| Status      | Meaning                              |\n| ----------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| `delivered` | Recipient's server confirmed receipt |","table":"table-0"},"2730":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/first-email-26","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/first-email","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/first-email#1-check-dashboard-logs","content":"| Status    | Meaning                               |\n| --------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| `bounced` | Recipient's server rejected the email |","table":"table-0"},"2731":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/first-email-27","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/first-email","tags