L shorteners in email body"},"2910":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting-79","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting#blocked-recipient-suppression-list","content":"If a recipient previously bounced or marked your email as spam, they may be on your suppression list."},"2911":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting-80","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting#blocked-recipient-suppression-list","content":"Check the suppression list in **Dashboard → Email Logs → Suppressions**"},"2912":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting-81","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting#blocked-recipient-suppression-list","content":"Remove the address from the suppression list if you believe the issue is resolved"},"2913":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting-82","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting#blocked-recipient-suppression-list","content":"Re-sending to suppressed addresses without removing them first will result in a silent drop"},"2914":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting-83","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting#diagnostic-tools","content":"NorthRelay provides built-in tools to diagnose sending issues:"},"2915":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting-84","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting#diagnostic-tools","content":"| Tool                 | Location                             | Purpose                                                                          |\n| -------------------- | ------------------------------------ | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Pre-Flight Check** | Dashboard → Tools → Pre-Flight Check | Validates DNS records, authentication, and sending configuration before you send |","table":"table-1"},"2916":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting-85","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting#diagnostic-tools","content":"| Tool                  | Location                      | Purpose                                                                      |\n| --------------------- | ----------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Blocklist Monitor** | Dashboard → Tools → Blocklist | Checks your sending IPs against 13 industry-standard DNS blocklist providers |","table":"table-1"},"2917":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting-86","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting#diagnostic-tools","content":"| Tool                    | Location                         | Purpose                                                                 |\n| ----------------------- | -------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Connectivity Doctor** | Dashboard → Tools → Connectivity | Tests SMTP connectivity and TLS configuration from NorthRelay's servers |","table":"table-1"},"2918":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting-87","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting#getting-help","content":"If you are still experiencing issues after trying the steps above:"},"2919":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting-88","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting#getting-help","content":"Check the **Dashboard → Email Logs** for detailed error messages"},"2920":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting-89","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting#getting-help","content":"Run the diagnostic tools listed above"},"2921":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting-90","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting#getting-help","content":"Review the DNS Setup Guide and SMTP Configuration guides"},"2922":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting-91","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting#getting-help","content":"Contact support at **support@northrelay.ca** with your account email and the message ID from the Email Logs"},"2923":{"id":"/docs/guides/dns-setup","page_id":"/docs/guides/dns-setup","type":"page","content":"DNS Setup Guide","breadcrumbs":["NorthRelay Documentation","Guides"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/guides/dns-setup"},"2924":{"id":"/docs/guides/dns-setup-0","page_id":"/docs/guides/dns-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guides/dns-setup","content":"Configure SPF, DKIM, and DMARC for optimal email deliverability"},"2925":{"id":"/docs/guides/dns-setup-1","page_id":"/docs/guides/dns-setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guides/dns-setup#dns-setup-guide","content":"DNS Setup Guide"},"2926":{"id":"/docs/guides/dns-setup-2","page_id":"/docs/guides/dns-setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guides/dns-setup#overview","content":"Overview"},"2927":{"id":"/docs/guides/dns-setup-3","page_id":"/docs/guides/dns-setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guides/dns-setup#spf-record","content":"SPF Record"},"2928":{"id":"/docs/guides/dns-setup-4","page_id":"/docs/guides/dns-setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guides/dns-setup#what-to-add","content":"What to Add"},"2929":{"id":"/docs/guides/dns-setup-5","page_id":"/docs/guides/dns-setup","