)."},"4043":{"id":"/docs/sdks/python-22","page_id":"/docs/sdks/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/python#quick-start","content":"`async with` closes the HTTP connection pool on exit; without it, call `await client.close()` when you are done."},"4044":{"id":"/docs/sdks/python-23","page_id":"/docs/sdks/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/python#configuration","content":"| Option    | Type  | Default    | Description             |\n| --------- | ----- | ---------- | ----------------------- |\n| `api_key` | `str` | *required* | Your NorthRelay API key |","table":"table-0"},"4045":{"id":"/docs/sdks/python-24","page_id":"/docs/sdks/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/python#configuration","content":"| Option     | Type  | Default                     | Description  |\n| ---------- | ----- | --------------------------- | ------------ |\n| `base_url` | `str` | `https://app.northrelay.ca` | API base URL |","table":"table-0"},"4046":{"id":"/docs/sdks/python-25","page_id":"/docs/sdks/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/python#configuration","content":"| Option    | Type    | Default | Description                |\n| --------- | ------- | ------- | -------------------------- |\n| `timeout` | `float` | `30.0`  | Request timeout in seconds |","table":"table-0"},"4047":{"id":"/docs/sdks/python-26","page_id":"/docs/sdks/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/python#configuration","content":"| Option        | Type  | Default | Description                      |\n| ------------- | ----- | ------- | -------------------------------- |\n| `max_retries` | `int` | `3`     | Max attempts for retryable reads |","table":"table-0"},"4048":{"id":"/docs/sdks/python-27","page_id":"/docs/sdks/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/python#configuration","content":"| Option        | Type    | Default | Description                    |\n| ------------- | ------- | ------- | ------------------------------ |\n| `retry_delay` | `float` | `1.0`   | Initial retry delay in seconds |","table":"table-0"},"4049":{"id":"/docs/sdks/python-28","page_id":"/docs/sdks/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/python#configuration","content":"| Option            | Type    | Default | Description              |\n| ----------------- | ------- | ------- | ------------------------ |\n| `max_retry_delay` | `float` | `10.0`  | Cap on the backoff delay |","table":"table-0"},"4050":{"id":"/docs/sdks/python-29","page_id":"/docs/sdks/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/python#mailing-lists-and-subscriptions","content":"See the Mailing Lists guide for the full integration and the Subscriptions API for request and response details. Results are Pydantic models with snake_case attributes (`result.contact_id`, `status.unsubscribed_from_all`)."},"4051":{"id":"/docs/sdks/python-30","page_id":"/docs/sdks/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/python#subscriptions","content":"| Method                                                                                                                                                                                             | Endpoint              | Returns           |\n| -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------- | ----------------- |\n| `subscriptions.subscribe(email, *, first_name, last_name, phone, list_ids, topic_ids, tags, custom_fields, metadata, double_opt_in, confirmation_template_id, redirect_url, resubscribe, consent)` | `POST /subscriptions` | `SubscribeResult` |","table":"table-1"},"4052":{"id":"/docs/sdks/python-31","page_id":"/docs/sdks/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/python#subscriptions","content":"| Method                                     | Endpoint                                 | Returns           |\n| ------------------------